1
00:00:00,979 --> 00:00:02,549
(Leonard:)Well, Vegas, but...

2
00:00:02,547 --> 00:00:04,377
(Sheldon:)Ugh, Atlantic City
without the taffy?

3
00:00:04,383 --> 00:00:05,913
(Sheldon:)No, thank you.

4
00:00:07,085 --> 00:00:09,255
(Leonard:)That's fine, 'cause actually
you're not invited.

5
00:00:09,254 --> 00:00:11,284
(Sheldon:)Well, now...
well, that's hurtful.

6
00:00:11,289 --> 00:00:13,419
(Penny:)Oh, Sheldon, you don't
even like it there.

7
00:00:13,425 --> 00:00:14,995
(Sheldon:)I can consider a place

8
00:00:14,993 --> 00:00:16,263
(Sheldon:)America's urinal cake

9
00:00:16,261 --> 00:00:18,991
(Sheldon:)and still enjoy
the occasional visit.

10
00:00:18,997 --> 00:00:20,767
(Leonard:)Not this time.

11
00:00:20,766 --> 00:00:23,296
(Sheldon:)Oh, fine. Then I'll just
hang out with Wolowitz.

12
00:00:23,301 --> 00:00:25,901
(Leonard:)He's coming, too.
Well, then Raj and I will...

13
00:00:25,904 --> 00:00:28,674
(Leonard:)Nope.
Very well. Stuart.

14
00:00:28,673 --> 00:00:30,173
(Leonard:)Oh, great. Do that.

15
00:00:31,676 --> 00:00:34,146
(Sheldon:)Ugh. Stuart.

16
00:00:35,347 --> 00:00:37,317
(Amy(on Skype):)Hi, Sheldon. What's new?

17
00:00:37,315 --> 00:00:39,845
(Sheldon:)Our friends are jerks,
and I'm mad at all of them.

18
00:00:39,851 --> 00:00:42,721
I said, “What's new?” but sure.

19
00:00:43,522 --> 00:00:45,052
(Sheldon:)Can you believe
they planned a trip

20
00:00:45,056 --> 00:00:47,026
(Sheldon:)to Las Vegas
and didn't invite me?

21
00:00:47,025 --> 00:00:48,655
(Amy:)Did you refuse to apologize

22
00:00:48,660 --> 00:00:51,060
(Amy:)and act like they were stupid
for being mad?

23
00:00:52,097 --> 00:00:54,127
(Sheldon:)You know, I liked it better
when there was still

24
00:00:54,132 --> 00:00:56,402
(Sheldon:)a little mystery left
in our relationship.

25
00:00:57,202 --> 00:00:59,232
(Amy:)Everyone tried
to take care of you,

26
00:00:59,237 --> 00:01:01,367
(Amy:)and you were nothing
but mean to them.

